{"version":1,"key":"card:652","content":{"id":652,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0b4d18b3-8c8a-4357-bd68-c9bb6b563951","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在琢磨 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":651,"contentId":4906,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"231b562b-2cf2-4726-9991-dfafcafdbeed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"破窗效应"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":649,"contentId":4900,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"9c734495-4b06-4bdf-bfd1-41ee76183d83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"滑梯效应"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，我发现这两个概念非常相似：它们都在强调“第一步”——无论是打破第一扇窗，还是踏上滑梯的顶端，都会让事态不可避免地滑向混乱。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d62883a8-050f-4b2f-9dc2-75ba1f9cfa7a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但仔细拆解后，会发现两者的侧重点其实大有径庭："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9cd859e3-3fee-499b-8669-04dc60348dc1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b89a2b5e-578f-4d18-9438-eb0d21c9aa38","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a79cde92-2afb-4d36-8aee-196c1b9ee32d","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"破窗效应"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：更侧重于"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"环境的暗示作用"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。它在探讨一种社会心理，即一个破败的信号（第一扇破窗）是如何诱发群体性的放任，最终导致犯罪或秩序崩塌。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c5e48dc3-0ad6-4409-86f2-8668952fce85","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"800cb292-7ba2-4428-a8a0-7dec047efcf9","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"滑梯效应"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：更侧重于"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"行为的惯性力量"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。它解释了为什么一旦你主动迈出了那一步，就会产生一种“身不由己”的加速度，让你极难在中途止损，只能直奔深渊。"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","title":"举个例子","calloutType":"info","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"4bd27c60-71a0-4dba-8eeb-5cf226896dac","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1993ac8c-2a5c-49be-a5ee-e89ba00c3e8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想象你在尝试“减肥”这件事："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0cb1376a-434f-43a0-ba65-c38ad3ca9c21","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7c284bd4-1832-425c-9e7c-888ac0b818f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dea1b5b3-2db4-42d0-ae68-5e0b710a4ffb","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"破窗效应"},{"type":"formatted","text":"是：你看到桌上已经堆满了别人吃剩的包装袋（破窗），于是心想“反正这屋子已经这么乱了，大家都在吃”，你也跟着撕开了一包薯片。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"30135ffe-1352-422b-a679-76bbde0ac98c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"461e4fbd-1cc8-4078-b5a9-22052e07cc95","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"滑梯效应"},{"type":"formatted","text":"是：你心软对自己说“就吃这一口”（迈出第一步），结果这一口多巴胺瞬间击垮了你的意志力，让你根本停不下来，最后演变成暴饮暴食的一顿大餐。"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["概念对比"],"createTime":1767144500750,"updateTime":1767178840175,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767178840175},"links":{"card:651":{"key":"card:651","type":"card","id":651},"card:649":{"key":"card:649","type":"card","id":649}}}